// SniperRifle: unified animation frames; one physical sprite/brightmap per tic.
// Existing artwork, logical attack events and offsets are preserved.

// Modded trail textures retain the unfiltered rendering of the shared originals.
nofilter MD3/PROJECTILES/Modded/SniperRifle/rtrlSS.png
nofilter MD3/PROJECTILES/Modded/SniperRifle/rtrlQW.png

